# One resolver per line.
# IPv6 literals are accepted directly; bracket them when specifying a port:
#   2606:4700:4700::1111
#   [2001:4860:4860::8888]:53
# With RESOLVER_IP_MODE="auto", IPv4 is preferred and these become warm
# fallbacks. IPv6 CIDRs up to 65,536 usable addresses are also accepted.
# Supported formats:
#   8.8.8.8
#   1.1.1.1:5353
#   192.168.1.0/30
#   192.168.1.0/30:5353
#   [2001:4860:4860::8888]:53

8.8.8.8
